  "G1_C": "decorator/code dispatcher registration; immutable actual repo/DB/conn/nonce/pid/tid/root-job binding; exact helper and same-job internal nested event/cancel/publication allowlist; independently verified negative-only generic route. Exact owner/TLS teardown in outer finally preserves real original COMMIT-close errors; nonnull TLS grants nothing.",
  "G2": "session actual epoch/job/lease/process exact negative finally closes only old open attempt/unreleased lease/nonterminal owned residual; orphan three durable phases proven epoch ended/process dead/mismatch only; canonical digest CAS, no unknown-live foreign cleanup, no reissue, repeats no mutation.",
  "G3_G4": "issued independent frozen bindings/session/repo/resolvedDB/conn/nonce/pid/tids/full snapshot/purpose/digest; owner-controlled lifecycles and one-use proposal/ack; exact queue request/reply/consume association retains original previous/new segment handles, fresh owner-thread D_lease read; timeout cancels/unusable immediately and blocks late reply.",
